 * TLS certificate paths are read exclusively from the environment variables
 * TLS_CERT_PATH and TLS_KEY_PATH.  No hard-coded paths or fallback secrets
 * are used; if the variables are absent the exported tlsConfig will be null,
 * which tells the server to skip HTTPS.
 */

