 * config.js
 *
 * Central configuration module. TLS settings are driven by two environment
 * variables so that no certificate paths are ever hard-coded:
 *
 *   TLS_CERT_PATH  – absolute (or relative) path to the PEM certificate file
 *   TLS_KEY_PATH   – absolute (or relative) path to the PEM private-key file
